 DEVELOPERS                       |   1 +
 board/zynqmp/readme.txt          |  17 +-
 board/zynqmp/zcu104/pm_cfg_obj.c | 503 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 configs/zynqmp_zcu104_defconfig  |  40 ++++
 4 files changed, 555 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

